&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in affiliate marketing, partnerships, performance marketing, or business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing strategic affiliate partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
