&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Proactive, open, effective, and constructive communication also in stressful situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Ability of self-criticism and assessing own strengths and weaknesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Role-model for junior engineers, as a technical expert and mentor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;English, fluent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;German, fluent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Knowledge of rocket propulsion technology and/or test facility and launch pad design for aerospace applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Knowledge of mechanical aspects of process plant engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Structural, thermal, vibration analysis experience in Ansys, NASTRAN or similar&lt;/li&gt;
